// 1000 bars = 250 ADJACENT written R1*4. The heavy side of "a written rest opens a run":
// before the change this was ONE run of 1000; now it is 250 runs of 4, so the output
// DIFFERS BY DESIGN and the hash must not match. Charges the run walk and 250 MMR layouts.
octave absolute
time 4/4

part solo { clef treble }

section A {
